  "title": "Remote monitoring and control of manufacturing system",
  "abstract": "This paper presents the development of a remote monitoring and control system for a CIM plant. It discusses the main steps for the system specification. The purpose of the remote access system is to provide the user with facilities necessary to understand the system behavior, propose supervisory control strategies and test them. Copyright; © 2006 International Federation for Information Processing.",
